{"3871150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Throne Alone", "steam_appid": 3871150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i><strong>Throne Alone</strong></i>, a merciless, physics-based rage platformer set inside a mysterious desert testing ground. With no limbs, no wheels, and little explanation, you must hurl, strafe, and fall your way through a brutal, punishing gauntlet built to break you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>• Be The Toilet •</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics and momentum-based movement. Launch yourself with precision - or suffer humiliating setbacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/3fb7eb445de71ea39a4a9ee4ce4a41ad.poster.avif?t=1761928129\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/3fb7eb445de71ea39a4a9ee4ce4a41ad.webm?t=1761928129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/3fb7eb445de71ea39a4a9ee4ce4a41ad.mp4?t=1761928129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>• Endure The Supervisor •</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He watches. He critiques. He insults. And sometimes… he encourages you to “Continue.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/a392eacd08c822b52834bf316513460a.poster.avif?t=1761928129\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/a392eacd08c822b52834bf316513460a.webm?t=1761928129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/a392eacd08c822b52834bf316513460a.mp4?t=1761928129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>• A Brutal Environment •</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl through a sun-scorched desert, a collapsing dungeon, and an otherworldly realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/c410594512d791cbb7b4fbfb057ae706.poster.avif?t=1761928129\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/c410594512d791cbb7b4fbfb057ae706.webm?t=1761928129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/c410594512d791cbb7b4fbfb057ae706.mp4?t=1761928129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>• Anubis is watching •</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach ancient statues to save your session-progress. Fail to reach one? Enjoy the long fall back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/8d5c51d09ca370b8170818c0b093cd59.poster.avif?t=1761928129\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/8d5c51d09ca370b8170818c0b093cd59.webm?t=1761928129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/8d5c51d09ca370b8170818c0b093cd59.mp4?t=1761928129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>• Inspired By The Best(Or Worst?) •</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in the spirit of punishing games like <i>Getting Over It</i>, <i>Alt+F4</i>, and <i>A Difficult Game About Climbing.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/7d733b2c669680547cc7ddc362bfe8d0.poster.avif?t=1761928129\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/7d733b2c669680547cc7ddc362bfe8d0.webm?t=1761928129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/7d733b2c669680547cc7ddc362bfe8d0.mp4?t=1761928129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i><strong>Throne Alone</strong></i>, a merciless, physics-based rage platformer set inside a mysterious desert testing ground. With no limbs, no wheels, and little explanation, you must hurl, strafe, and fall your way through a brutal, punishing gauntlet built to break you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>• Be The Toilet •</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics and momentum-based movement. Launch yourself with precision - or suffer humiliating setbacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/3fb7eb445de71ea39a4a9ee4ce4a41ad.poster.avif?t=1761928129\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/3fb7eb445de71ea39a4a9ee4ce4a41ad.webm?t=1761928129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/3fb7eb445de71ea39a4a9ee4ce4a41ad.mp4?t=1761928129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>• Endure The Supervisor •</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He watches. He critiques. He insults. And sometimes… he encourages you to “Continue.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/a392eacd08c822b52834bf316513460a.poster.avif?t=1761928129\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/a392eacd08c822b52834bf316513460a.webm?t=1761928129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/a392eacd08c822b52834bf316513460a.mp4?t=1761928129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>• A Brutal Environment •</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl through a sun-scorched desert, a collapsing dungeon, and an otherworldly realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/c410594512d791cbb7b4fbfb057ae706.poster.avif?t=1761928129\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/c410594512d791cbb7b4fbfb057ae706.webm?t=1761928129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/c410594512d791cbb7b4fbfb057ae706.mp4?t=1761928129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>• Anubis is watching •</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach ancient statues to save your session-progress. Fail to reach one? Enjoy the long fall back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/8d5c51d09ca370b8170818c0b093cd59.poster.avif?t=1761928129\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/8d5c51d09ca370b8170818c0b093cd59.webm?t=1761928129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/8d5c51d09ca370b8170818c0b093cd59.mp4?t=1761928129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>• Inspired By The Best(Or Worst?) •</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in the spirit of punishing games like <i>Getting Over It</i>, <i>Alt+F4</i>, and <i>A Difficult Game About Climbing.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/7d733b2c669680547cc7ddc362bfe8d0.poster.avif?t=1761928129\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/7d733b2c669680547cc7ddc362bfe8d0.webm?t=1761928129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871150/extras/7d733b2c669680547cc7ddc362bfe8d0.mp4?t=1761928129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Not your average toilet-sim: Throne Alone is a cursed physics platformer where gravity hates you, progress is pain, and a blue floating face roasts your every moment.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https